---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Tujuan & Hakekat - KPA Trinawa Bhuwana SMAN 39 Jakarta">
  <main class="w-full pt-20 bg-surface min-h-screen">
    
    <!-- HERO HEADER -->
    <section class="relative w-full py-14 md:py-20 px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#065143]/15 via-surface to-surface overflow-hidden border-b border-outline-variant/30">
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-[#065143]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 bg-[#FF8000]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="max-w-[1080px] mx-auto relative z-10 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
        <!-- Breadcrumb -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
          <a href={`${base}/`} class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Beranda</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <a href={`${base}/dokumen`} class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Dokumen</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <span class="text-primary font-bold">Tujuan &amp; Hakekat</span>
        </div>

        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">target</span>
          <span>Filosofi &amp; Landasan Budi Pekerti</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-on-surface tracking-tight uppercase leading-tight font-display">
          Tujuan &amp; Hakekat <br />
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-primary via-tertiary to-secondary">
            Trinawa Bhuwana
          </span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Karakter kepribadian yang tanggap, tanggon, dan trengginas. Menjadi pedoman moral bagi setiap insan anggota rimba SMAN 39 Jakarta.
        </p>

        <!-- Sub Nav Pills -->
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-surface-container-low p-1.5 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30">
          <a href={`${base}/dokumen/kode-etik`} class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            Kode Etik
          </a>
          <a href={`${base}/dokumen/undang-undang`} class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            Undang-Undang
          </a>
          <a href={`${base}/dokumen/anggaran-rumah-tangga`} class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            ART &amp; PDF Embed
          </a>
          <a href={`${base}/dokumen/tujuan-hakekat`} class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-primary text-white shadow-xs">
            Tujuan &amp; Hakekat
          </a>
          <a href={`${base}/dokumen/tata-tertib`} class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            Tata Tertib
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CONTENT BODY: DUA PILAR BESAR -->
    <section class="w-full py-16 md:py-24 px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-12 bg-surface">
      <div class="max-w-[1080px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
        
        <!-- KOLOM 1: HAKEKAT ANGGOTA (UU TNB PASAL 4 AYAT 2) -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[30px]">psychology</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Undang-Undang TNB Pasal 4 Ayat 2</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-on-surface uppercase tracking-tight mt-1 mb-6">
              Hakekat Anggota
            </h2>

            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant/20 flex items-start gap-3.5">
                <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</div>
                <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface leading-relaxed">
                  <strong>Percaya dan Taqwa kepada Tuhan Yang Maha Esa:</strong> Menempatkan nilai spiritual sebagai dasar seluruh perilaku dan kegiatan rimba.
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant/20 flex items-start gap-3.5">
                <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</div>
                <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface leading-relaxed">
                  <strong>Mengabdi dan berbakti kepada nusa, bangsa, dan negara Republik Indonesia:</strong> Menjunjung integritas kebangsaan dan kedaulatan tanah air.
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant/20 flex items-start gap-3.5">
                <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</div>
                <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface leading-relaxed">
                  <strong>Disiplin, berani, bertanggung jawab, dan suka bermusyawarah:</strong> Tangguh dalam mengambil keputusan dan menjunjung konsensus bersama.
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant/20 flex items-start gap-3.5">
                <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">4</div>
                <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface leading-relaxed">
                  <strong>Rela berkorban, cinta alam, dan tabah:</strong> Menjaga alam dengan keikhlasan hati serta tahan uji dalam cuaca dan medan berat.
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant/20 flex items-start gap-3.5">
                <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs shrink-0 mt-0.5">5</div>
                <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface leading-relaxed">
                  <strong>Setia, patuh, dan dapat dipercaya:</strong> Menjaga janji rimba, amanah organisasi, serta kejujuran kepada sesama.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- KOLOM 2: TUJUAN ORGANISASI (ART TNB BAB III PASAL 7) -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[30px]">flag</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary">ART TNB Bab III Pasal 7</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-on-surface uppercase tracking-tight mt-1 mb-6">
              Tujuan Organisasi
            </h2>

            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[28px] shrink-0 mt-1">nature</span>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-black text-on-surface uppercase">1. Cinta Alam &amp; Tanah Air</h4>
                  <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                    Memperkuat rasa disiplin dan kecintaan kepada alam serta tanah air Indonesia sebagai bagian agung dari ciptaan Tuhan Yang Maha Esa.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-secondary/5 border border-secondary/20 flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[28px] shrink-0 mt-1">shield</span>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-black text-on-surface uppercase">2. Rasa Tanggung Jawab</h4>
                  <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                    Menanamkan rasa tanggung jawab dalam melaksanakan segala bentuk kegiatan, manajemen risiko, dan keselamatan rekan seperjalanan.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/5 border border-amber-500/20 flex items-start gap-4">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-amber-600 text-[28px] shrink-0 mt-1">groups</span>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-sm font-black text-on-surface uppercase">3. Tali Persaudaraan</h4>
                  <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                    Mempererat rasa persaudaraan dalam lingkungan masyarakat pada umumnya dan keluarga besar anggota Trinawa Bhuwana pada khususnya.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3 PILAR MOTTO DI BAWAH -->
          <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-outline-variant/20 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center">
            <div class="p-3 bg-primary/10 rounded-xl">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-primary">Pilar 1</span>
              <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase text-primary mt-0.5">Disiplin</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-secondary/10 rounded-xl">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Pilar 2</span>
              <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase text-secondary mt-0.5">Tanggung Jawab</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-xl">
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-amber-700">Pilar 3</span>
              <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase text-amber-700 mt-0.5">Persaudaraan</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
